{"data":{"results":[{"id":"e99471aa-31c4-4952-abf6-99905445f43b","name":"Decentraland Foundation","description":"Your hub for official Decentraland updates and events. \n\nKeep up with All Hands, weekly rituals, and more—all in one place.","ownerAddress":"0xbcac4dafb7e215f2f6cb3312af6d5e4f9d9e7eda","privacy":"public","active":true,"membersCount":1303,"voiceChatStatus":{"isActive":false,"participantCount":0,"moderatorCount":0}},{"id":"c1bf2ebe-d1d2-4edc-9488-1047689640cb","name":"Chiri Storytelling","description":"This space brings to life Chiri's adventures. Gathering cozy Social Gamers, Creators, Digi Fashion lovers, Virtual Citizens & more!\r\nWe will share different activities in Chiri's hood better known as the Impossible Dimension a balance of Nature, Technology and Magic. Here the story expands, and fam can follow Chiri's journey, sharing Weekly Chapters, Merch Drops, Online Cowork, Collabs, Art expos, Workshops, Treasure Hunt & lots of fun activities!\r\nThis is a gender inclusive safe space.","ownerAddress":"0xfbf7e572a63ca6a4e21a83720c0f23dd644e32e0","privacy":"public","active":true,"membersCount":403,"voiceChatStatus":{"isActive":false,"participantCount":0,"moderatorCount":0}},{"id":"3ca51536-f8aa-4f94-b172-d8ff9a6abfe4","name":"ABC Decentraland","description":"Adventures, learning Basics and Chill time in Decentraland!\n\nWe host a weekly tour around Decentraland (main event time is Saturdays 11 PM UTC with a second event time on Thursdays 10am UTC), exploring new and old scenes with your hosts Awedjob, BillyTeacoin and ToxicWaifu.","ownerAddress":"0x09bc69a986e1b37fb01ef36124f4c2e14fa0ab6b","privacy":"public","active":true,"membersCount":462,"voiceChatStatus":{"isActive":false,"participantCount":0,"moderatorCount":0}},{"id":"375e83ce-680f-44d5-a8d0-568fa63fa360","name":"VTATV","description":"Here we share events shown in the metaverse in real time also we show case educational sessions. Media nights is a fun thing as well we do plus we offer job fair virtually. Please check out VTATV.io for more information or links at LINKTR.EE/VTATV you will find all information needed on these sites. \n\nWe will also post and share collabs avil with pay (irl,virtually or digitally).\n\nPlease email <<REDACTED:email>> for more questions and concerns.","ownerAddress":"0x60e7357de5ec8c3b07f8efb3a8c1325811eb7db0","privacy":"public","active":true,"membersCount":198,"voiceChatStatus":{"isActive":false,"participantCount":0,"moderatorCount":0}},{"id":"55e64582-f8c6-4e81-a097-690dab5b4549","name":"AN TE LA (Community)","description":"An Té La is a creative community born in the Caribbean and open to the world through Web3. \nWe share our culture, our music, and our lifestyle to build bridges between people all around the globe.\n\n","ownerAddress":"0x5854cce95d5e25817b41f4c41f06b695a83bc495","privacy":"public","active":true,"membersCount":115,"voiceChatStatus":{"isActive":false,"participantCount":0,"moderatorCount":0}}],"total":143,"page":1,"pages":29,"limit":5}}